  "ALL_TEXT": "61 EXT. ROAD - DAY \nVEDA waves to a woman in burqha. Standing next to him is \nGOVARDHAN in a burqha. \nGOVARDHAN \nAipoindhi..anta aipondhi.. Na life \nnashnam chesaavu.. inka na desku \npoyindhi udyogam kuda poyindhi \n...oke oka solution nuvvu police \ndhagariki raa.. Nuvey murder chesav \nani opuko, naaku dhiniki ey \nsamabandham ledhu ani oppuko.. \nAppudey na jeevitham manchiga \nuntadhi..na desk naaku vosthadhi \nVEDA \nNee yebba ne bodi desk gurinchi na \njeevithani nasanam chesukomantaava. \nGOVARDHAN \nNuvvu ikkada kakapothey akkadaina \nanubhavinchalsindhey \nVEDA \nNenu ranu \nGOVARDHAN \nOhoo .. Aithey nen chepptha - \"sir \nna peru GOVARDHAN BDBI Bank \nemployee ni ... podhuna office ki \nbaildherthey veedey accident chesi \nna dabba tho vallani champadu \nsir\".. ani chepptha \nVEDA \nAppudu nenu cheptha- \"Na peru VEDA \nsir.. Nen road paina velthuntey \nveedu addu osthey nen velli car \ngudhaanu.. Ethaney dabba iche \nvaallani kottmannaadu.. Nen odhu \nantey.. vallani kotti champi car \nthagalapettadu sir\" \nGOVARDHAN \nCar kalchaanna ? Durmarguda enni \nabbadhaalu chepptav ra \nVEDA \nMari nannu erikisthaava.. Asalu \nchanipoindhi evaro thelidhu \nGOVARDHAN \n(Scared, whispers) \nNuvve champaava VEDA? \nVEDA \n(Surprised and irritated) \nNenu eppudu champuthaanu!!?? Nee \ntho paate unnaa ga!? Nuvvu unnaavu \nga akkada... Antha chusaavu ga!!... \nThe PUG is licking VEDA's face. VEDA tries to push it away. \nVEDA \nBha! Nuv aagu!! \nHe talks to GOVARDHAN \nVEDA \nSare mundhu bandi ekku \nCUT TO: ",
